  "description": "The URS 01 LT TWO is for riders who treat rough terrain like an invitation, pairing the BMC 01 Premium Carbon layup with our integrated suspension and a handpicked selection of Shimano’s burliest gravel-specific components that won’t flinch when the terrain gets rowdy.\nWith 20mm of Micro Travel Technology integrated into the fork and seatstays, this gravel bike encourages you to always choose the most fun line, letting the bike do exactly what it was engineered for: glide over the rough stuff.\nShimano’s GRX groupset keeps shifting smooth and braking efficient when the conditions decidedly aren’t, while the tubeless-ready GR650 wheels with 45 mm Continental Terra Adventure bring confidence to loose corners and bad ideas.\nAdd in on-frame storage, cargo mounts, integration and cockpit adjustability and you’ll realize this adventure gravel bike is way more prepared than you’ll ever be.",
